veSuslinOperation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveSuslinOperation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveSuslinOperation}_S(B,\\vec A,e,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputablePredicate}_S(e)\\land\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in\\vec A(s)\\leftrightarrow s^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\\in e)\\land B=\\bigcup_{f\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(f\\upharpoonright n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveSuslinOperation}_S(B,\\vec A,e,X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2ComputablePredicate}_S(e)\\land\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in\\vec A(s)\\leftrightarrow s^\\frown\\langle x\\rangle\\in e)\\land B=\\bigcup_{f\\in\\omega^\\omega}\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(f\\upharpoonright n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The base space is a coded subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> is a uniformly computable membership code for the entire indexed set scheme; the final clause is the Suslin <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>-operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text